<document ids="math-as-html-with-a-linked-stylesheet" names="math\ as\ html\ with\ a\ linked\ stylesheet" source="testdata/fixtures/math_html_link.rst" title="Math as HTML with a linked stylesheet">
    <title>
        Math as HTML with a linked stylesheet
    <paragraph>
        With 
        <literal>
            embed_stylesheet
         off, 
        <literal>
            math.css
         is linked:
        <math>
            \frac{a}{b}
         and
    <math_block xml:space="preserve">
        \left( \begin{matrix} a \\ b \end{matrix} \right)
